# sdist 边界：源码 + 测试 + 任务集与夹具保留（可从发行包复现评估），
# 运行产物（trace、报告）不进发行包。
include README.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include SECURITY.md
include LICENSE
include breeze.toml.example

graft tasks
graft fixtures
graft samples
graft scripts
graft breeze_eval

prune traces
prune reports
prune dist
prune build

global-exclude *.pyc
global-exclude __pycache__/*
